    "title": "[MRV2] Collect KV transfer results before the drafter runs",
    "body": "With a speculator, collect the KV connector's transfer results right after sampling and defer only `wait_for_save()` and `clear_connector_metadata()` until after the drafter, via a new `finalize_step()`. Finished loads are then reported without waiting for the drafter, and async loads start before it.\n\nNote this doesn't involve any changes to the KVConnector interface itself.",
